{# Chronological biography + notes + relations.

   `bio` is computed once in entity_default_narrative.j2 and shared with
   the links template (for occurrence numbering).
   NOTE_TYPES attributes -> "Notes" section; IDENTIFICATION_REL_TYPES
   relations -> separated out.

   For REntity (real entity) records, the timeline carries an extra "Occ"
   column linking each attribute row to the numbered occurrence it came
   from (the source entity). The occurrence numbers are also shown in the
   "Links for" table. #}
{# `bio` is already set by entity_default_narrative.j2 #}
{# Occurrence numbers are shown in the "Links for" table. #}
### Timeline

{% if bio.is_real_entity -%}
| Date | Type | Value | Note | Occ |
|------|------|-------|------|-----|
{% for grp in bio.timeline -%}
{% set date_str = "—" if (not grp.date or grp.date in ('0','00')) else util.format_timelink_date(grp.date) -%}
{% for it in grp.entries -%}
| {{ date_str }} | {{ type_link(it.type) }} | {{ value_link(it.type, it.value) }}{% if it.wd_qid %} → [[{{ it.wd_qid }}]]{% endif %} | {{ it.obs | replace('|', '\\|') | replace('\n', ' ') | trim }} | {% if it.occ_num %}[{{ it.occ_num }}]({{ it.source_entity }}){% else %}—{% endif %} |
{% endfor -%}
{% endfor %}
{% else -%}
| Date | Type | Value | Note |
|------|------|-------|------|
{% for grp in bio.timeline -%}
{% set date_str = "—" if (not grp.date or grp.date in ('0','00')) else util.format_timelink_date(grp.date) -%}
{% for it in grp.entries -%}
| {{ date_str }} | {{ type_link(it.type) }} | {{ value_link(it.type, it.value) }}{% if it.wd_qid %} → [[{{ it.wd_qid }}]]{% endif %} | {{ it.obs | replace('|', '\\|') | replace('\n', ' ') | trim }} |
{% endfor -%}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}

{% if bio.notes -%}
### Notes
{% for n in bio.notes -%}
**{{ n.type }} {{ n.value }}**. {{ n.obs }}
{% endfor -%}
{% endif %}

{% if bio.relations -%}
### Relations

| Date | Relation | Person | Note |
|------|----------|--------|------|
{% for rel in bio.relations -%}
| {{ rel.date_str or "—" }} | {{ relation_label(rel) }} | [{{ rel.other_name }}]({{ rel.other_id }}) | {{ rel.obs | replace('|', '\\|') | replace('\n', ' ') | trim }} |
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
